  "checks": [
    "Cancel crop keeps the full simulated source image",
    "Processed tools enable the processed preview",
    "Finished lane dividers enable lane tables and image export",
    "Submitting a positive ladder label closes the MW editor",
    "Copy table includes measurement headers and numeric band intensities",
    "A baseline creates a peak integration and Divider splits it into separate rows",
    "Save retains the named gel, processing selections, and lane table",
    "Dragging two gel entries places them in the selected stack",
    "Apply trim leaves trim mode and retains the shared stack crop",
    "Save project serializes both gel layers and their stack into a portable JSON file",
    "Reopening the serialized practice project restores both layers and its stack without duplicating them",
    "Inline rename updates the selected gel entry"
  ]
